d22963c:.claude/skills/bootstrap/templates/apps/web/src/app/_components/version.test.tsx:16:  const server = getQueryClient();
d22963c:.claude/skills/bootstrap/templates/apps/web/src/app/_components/version.test.tsx:19:    <QueryClientProvider client={getQueryClient()}>
d22963c:factory/decisions/669.md:3:| S669a | A client component reads data with TanStack Query's `useQuery` through a server action, from the cache `getQueryClient` in `src/lib/query` gives, which the root layout provides. | It drops a late answer, caches each one and takes what the server read ahead, which each component wrote for itself before. | SWR: it takes the server's reads only as a fallback written out by hand. An effect and a timer in each component: each checked for the newest answer itself. | #669 |
